        "content": "**Empty error panels are correct.** There have been no 5xx responses\nthrough this gateway in recent history.\n\n**`unknown` destination service** is traffic rejected before routing —\na bad Host header or no matching route. Expect it in every breakdown.\n\n**Retention is ~10 days** and there is no Thanos datasource, so ranges\nlonger than that will return nothing.\n\n**Alerts on this signal:**\n`IstioIngressGateway5xxErrors` (P2, >10 5xx in 5m) and\n`IstioHighErrorRate` (P1, >5% for 10m at >1 req/s).\nThere is no latency alert yet.",
